 1 Schadenspunkt zu.", \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a1b1587-6ca1-4ff9-b2fd-af95d4ecbebe\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Dardos de Telim\'Tor", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29a697bf-2d10-4aa8-8751-72bb97329ae8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Fléchettes de Telim\' Tor", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87b6d83f-59f4-4712-bd28-359eba06af3b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Dardi di Telim\'Tor", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7e6baa5-7563-4867-8548-12641aeec525\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'テリムトーの投げ矢\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22dde905-9085-46e7-8fdc-c1c444f066eb\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Dardos de TelimíTor\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23e70294-c052-4fc7-bb03-1966d8aef86d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Aas', 'text': 'Opfere eine Kreatur, um eine Anzahl an Maden-Spielsteinen in der Höhe der Stärke dieser Kreatur ins Spiel zu bringen. Behandle diese Spielsteine wie 0/1 schwarze Kreaturen.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1bd9820c-0612-41fa-bf65-362f157df59d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Carroña', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8d911f1-4511-4599-8ebd-8390d3a17850'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Charogne', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07de849e-d3dc-4cbc-a54a-eec4cf3d372a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Carogna', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e34ffeb-400e-4582-8b2f-00c8a732bdf7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '屍肉', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f78b0548-ef06-4aaf-9673-e587eb740883'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Carniça', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e9ee474-146a-444c-820d-092cfd677c58'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Afiyahain\', \'text\': \'Der Afiyahain kommt mit drei +1/+1 Marken ins Spiel.\\nLege während Deiner Versorgungsphase eine dieser Marken auf eine Kreatur Deiner Wahl.\\nWenn der Afiyahain keine dieser Marken mehr hat, begrabe den Afiyahain.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d93d38b-1e08-4135-aa2a-9070da8a79ca\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Arboleda de Afiya\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38ef956d-a373-4f25-a602-49429bed45f4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Bosquet d\'afiyas", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a88ed27-eb73-4a18-8b3c-198f73b1967a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Frutteto di Afiya\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'943a0987-1536-4478-af2f-e990f3ff1ed5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'アフィヤの樹\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9ea4634-5f37-4c34-a71c-02891b7e9dc8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bosque de Afiya\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e4f1411-178a-43e8-a456-230bcf59fd7b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Alarmierung', 'text': 'Enttappe eine nicht angreifende Kreatur Deiner Wahl. Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16ade0b6-7f32-4ba5-87eb-dde36979a940'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Voz de alarma', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe008cd7-187a-4e2b-a389