eines Gegners unter Deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1d52f6b-eaa7-41d3-a671-67560ac12df4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Polvo ceniciento', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2e12c3c-410f-4e97-96b7-8bd394b4cb57'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Poudre de cendres', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b503556-12fb-47d1-84b2-adeca1304afd'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Polvere Cinerea', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96952aef-9328-4d4f-971f-cd317a269cba'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '死灰の秘粉', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8489c70-a21f-497c-b0fd-baeb35f8c1e8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Pó Cinerário', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '445b91d0-4b4d-4d0f-91ab-068f51d74fe9'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Aschenwolke', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Kreatur Deiner Wahl. Wenn eine weiße Kreatur auf diese Art auf dem Friedhof landet, fügt die Aschenwolke dem Beherrscher dieser Kreatur Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke dieser Kreatur zu.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d607a26-500c-43ea-91e2-fbd3739eda5f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Nube de cenizas', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c658f319-c452-44c6-806d-d57112d7fe2d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Nuage de cendres', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5201796b-6790-441d-af20-07a1b35c3b38'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Nube di Cenere', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2541376-54c3-46c5-825c-ac9bbefe5317'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '爆煙', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1f3f9c1-24c3-4cbe-99e4-f