ain de vie', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39403e34-4768-44b7-b5ef-870bac53cb0b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Risucchia Vita', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9af0f068-1e7c-426e-930c-31f1ba69f8ad'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '生命吸収', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8462367-a20d-4eb5-bab7-f3334e033a2a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Drenar Vida', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2c75b44-05ea-49e5-94d8-5f23c12b2b66'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Durst', 'text': 'Wenn der Durst ins Spiel kommt, tappe die verzauberte Kreatur.\\nBezahle während Deiner Versorgungsphase {U} oder begrabe den Durst.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur enttappt nicht während der Enttap-Phase ihres Beherrschers.', 'type': 'Verzaubere Kreatur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44bb4bbd-1b99-47d7-a827-f03e0dfda61b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sed', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '944e9a6d-6185-4355-a2cb-f4e693972a75'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Soif', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6326450-6248-4a23-a614-b9a2a03fadde'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sete', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '832cc9a0-d9f9-4ee4-a6c5-c2706ea07b83'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '渇き', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5c03b29-67cb-49d6-8a9c-0bf638d62dc7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sede', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45d3552d-f9a5-4e59-a805-1357a2d5aa43'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Düsterwasser', 'text': 'Das Düsterwasser kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}, opfere das Düsterwasser: Durchsuche Deine Bibliothek nach einer Inselkarte oder Sumpfkarte. Bringe dieses Land ins 