er nichtfliegenden Kreatur 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Elementar — wesens', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a3dd6ab-2533-4fec-adc7-7f0e6fc7f88d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Espíritu subterráneo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3200abf9-cd78-47d4-afff-31ec28f8dedb'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Esprit souterrain', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6059084-bb32-4920-8d9c-72677bd77aa9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Spirito Sotterraneo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3f48122-c2a7-406b-83f6-136fce8c608c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '地の底の精霊', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7dfaf56-8f27-4d90-a8e6-3b552e8bc5e0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Espírito Subterrâneo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17075bc3-c66c-42b7-be6f-c0fa34f36163'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Unterweltjäger', 'text': '{B}, {T}: Tappe eine Kreatur Deiner Wahl. Der Unterweltjäger fügt dieser Kreatur Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke des Unterweltjägers zu.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Jägers', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cea8b164-8828-4e9a-a77f-c78b0707636d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cazador abismal', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '391b03b3-4b4c-413c-ad27-2d81f0ef6c1a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Chasseur des abysses', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e6913bc-bc27-4bb1-8f85-bb6343b5a0b7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cacciatore degli Abissi', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45532fea-b183-4af5-8370-bebe44b78157'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '深淵の狩人', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46037795-68b1-